### Enterprise ATS — sample requests
### Install the "REST Client" (humao.rest-client) extension, then click
### "Send Request" above each block. Log in first, copy the access_token
### from the response into @token below, and the rest will work.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@token = PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE

### Health
GET http://localhost:8080/readyz

### Sign up (candidate)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "jane@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "full_name": "Jane Doe"
}

### Log in  ->  copy "tokens.access_token" from the response into @token above
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "jane@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Who am I
GET {{baseUrl}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update candidate profile (skills power the recruiter search)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/candidate/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "headline": "Backend engineer",
  "location": "Bengaluru",
  "skills": ["Go", "PostgreSQL", "Docker"]
}

### List open jobs (public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/jobs?status=open

### Create a job (needs a recruiter/admin token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/jobs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Backend Engineer",
  "description": "Build the ATS backend in Go.",
  "location": "Remote",
  "employment_type": "Full-time"
}

### Apply to job 1 (candidate)
POST {{baseUrl}}/jobs/1/apply
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cover_letter": "I would love to work on this."
}

### Search candidates by skill (recruiter/admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/candidates?skills=Go,PostgreSQL&match=all
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create an offer for application 1 (recruiter/admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/applications/1/offers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "position_title": "Backend Engineer",
  "salary_amount": 1200000,
  "salary_currency": "INR",
  "start_date": "2026-09-01"
}
